@vertixara/dsh-prompt-manager README · 🤖 关于这份代码 · About this code：- The ten fixes in 0.2.1 came from GPT 6.1 Sol's independent audit ([report](docs/audit-2026-10-23.md)). Each finding was checked against both this plugin's code and the host's shipped source before any change; none turned out to be a false positive. Three of them — endpoint authentication, concurrent writes, and route lifecycle — were verified on a live DSH install.
- The remaining seven are covered by 59 test cases, each named with its audit number. The suite runs the real `apply()` in-process against a mock ctx; no DSH process is required.
- Every claim in this README about host behaviour (the semantics of `interpolate: false`, the absence of an auth layer in `register()`, `section()` registering only once) was read from the host's installed implementation, not inferred.
